### POST example register request
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"jan.kowalski","password":"password1"}

### POST example login request
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"jan.kowalski", "password":"password1"}

### POST example create item request
POST http://localhost:8080/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Moja pierwsza notatka","content":"Treść notatki..."}

### GET example list items request
GET http://localhost:8080/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PATCH example update item request
PATCH http://localhost:8080/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Moja pierwsza notatka","content":"Treść notatki...", "version":1}

### DELETE example delete item request
DELETE http://localhost:8080/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}

### GET example item history request
GET http://localhost:8080/items/{{itemId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST example share item request
POST http://localhost:8080/items/{{itemId}}/share
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"99990000-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-ddddeeee1111","role":"EDITOR"}

### DELETE example revoke share request
DELETE http://localhost:8080/items/{{itemId}}/share/{{userId}}}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
